{"4168040": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "17 MPH", "steam_appid": 4168040, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What do you mean 17 MPH?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >17mph is the speed you need to maintain while maneuvering your off-road machine (with balls for wheels) through tricky terrain and over unconventional bridge-like contraptions. Also the car can jump.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4168040/extras/7f037210e4bde96dadc67345acdbb985.poster.avif?t=1764783967\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4168040/extras/7f037210e4bde96dadc67345acdbb985.webm?t=1764783967\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4168040/extras/7f037210e4bde96dadc67345acdbb985.mp4?t=1764783967\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What if i go too slow?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have 5 seconds to get back up to speed or 1 of 30 random effects will trigger and slightly or significantly hinder your progress. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4168040/extras/9906036f0e36273d5af2f3281b867962.poster.avif?t=1764783967\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4168040/extras/9906036f0e36273d5af2f3281b867962.webm?t=1764783967\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4168040/extras/9906036f0e36273d5af2f3281b867962.mp4?t=1764783967\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Regular Mode:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose an unlocked chapter to start your journey from and collect rare items that allow you to set a checkpoint wherever you want.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4168040/extras/d51efd69c0dad09645d380254862b3d3.avif?t=1764783967\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Nightmare Mode:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Closer to the classic &quot;rage game&quot; experience. If you get stuck or fall down, too bad.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4168040/extras/2240b57c56679b639b2e294e1a7d47ab.avif?t=1764783967\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What do you mean 17 MPH?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >17mph is the speed you need to maintain while maneuvering your off-road machine (with balls for wheels) through tricky terrain and over unconventional bridge-like contraptions. Also the car can jump.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4168040/extras/7f037210e4bde96dadc67345acdbb985.poster.avif?t=1764783967\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4168040/extras/7f037210e4bde96dadc67345acdbb985.webm?t=1764783967\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4168040/extras/7f037210e4bde96dadc67345acdbb985.mp4?t=1764783967\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What if i go too slow?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have 5 seconds to get back up to speed or 1 of 30 random effects will trigger and slightly or significantly hinder your progress. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4168040/extras/9906036f0e36273d5af2f3281b867962.poster.avif?t=1764783967\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4168040/extras/9906036f0e36273d5af2f3281b867962.webm?t=1764783967\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4168040/extras/9906036f0e36273d5af2f3281b867962.mp4?t=1764783967\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Regular Mode:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose an unlocked chapter to start your journey from and collect rare items that allow you to set a checkpoint wherever you want.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4168040/extras/d51efd69c0dad09645d380254862b3d3.avif?t=1764783967\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Nightmare Mode:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Closer to the classic &quot;rage game&quot; experience. If you get stuck or fall down, too bad.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4168040/extras/2240b57c56679b639b2e294e1a7d47ab.avif?t=1764783967\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>", "short_description": "Make your way through unusual off-road challenges with advanced suspension physics and weirdly shaped wheels, but don't go below 17 miles per hour or you will regret it.", "supported_languages": "English", "hea